title: Wormhole
text: The purple rings are TELEPORTERS. Light entering one comes out of the next one straight ahead, still going the same way, skipping anything in between, even a wall.
trick: a fixed teleporter pair carries the beam through a wall; it carries on after the jump
motif: a wall with a wormhole through it
